&lt;p style="margin-left: 65px; line-height: 14.666666666666666666666666667px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;2021年４月　養和監査法人代表社員（現任）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E32664-000HirachiTatsujiMember">（注）６</jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E32664-000TsuzikadoTomoyukiMember">監査役</jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
